### 1. Test Microsoft Edge Login (Direct Success Access)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/120.0.2210.91

{
  "email": "harshveena@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ---

### 2. Test Google Chrome Login (Triggers OTP Requirement)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36

{
  "email": "harshveena@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ---

### 3. Verify Chrome OTP (Check your server terminal for the printed 6-digit code)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/verify-chrome-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### ---

### 4. Test Mobile Login (Time Restricted: Only allowed between 10:00 AM – 1:00 PM)
# Note: Since it is currently past 1:00 PM, this should correctly block access!
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 16_0 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Mobile/15E148

{
  "email": "harshveena@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

